MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Cutscenes_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b3eec409a99cf0744945d380db858a5e, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 41571598336
    m_Localized: In the center of the universe, <p=2> there is a magic place in which...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48718692352
    m_Localized: You can taste the most exquisite and exotic savors in the galaxy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56469766144
    m_Localized: <sh>Heeeeeeeeeeeeeeelp!!!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 58717913088
    m_Localized: A little star suddenly appeared and crashed onto Chuchu's stand!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60953477120
    m_Localized: Oi welcome!<p=5> You want some ice-cream?<p=5> What flavor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63247761408
    m_Localized: I'm not here to order!<p=5> My friends have been captured by Queen
      Lychee for her grand party!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65630126080
    m_Localized: <w>Oh<p=2>oh<p=2>oh<p=2>oh!<p=5></w> These tiny plushies will be
      the centerpiece to make my party so stellar!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520832
    m_Localized: Please,<p=2> help us,<p=2> stellanaut Chuchu!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520833
    m_Localized: These words were enough to lighten the little jelly's heart!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520834
    m_Localized: You can count on me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520835
    m_Localized: And thus,<p=2> Chuchu went to the rescue to save these little star
      spirits, captures by the moon bunnies in the whole galaxy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520836
    m_Localized: 'Direction: <p=2> Bubble Beach Galaxy!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 55575863640064
    m_Localized: <p=5>.<p=5>.<p=5>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520838
    m_Localized: After saving the Star Spirits from Bubble Beach, <p=2>Chuchu is
      heading to Honey Hoop Galaxy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520839
    m_Localized: In the comfy bee kingdom, <p=2>she meets the queen Api-Api.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520840
    m_Localized: Hey,<p=2> welome to my eden, <p=2>little jelly.<p=5> Make yourself
      at home.<p=5>That's our moto here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520841
    m_Localized: Excuse me,<p=2> I'm looking for a Star Spirit who might be in your
      hive.<p=5> Does that ring any bell?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520842
    m_Localized: Does that have anything to do with honey?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520843
    m_Localized: Er...<p=5> no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520844
    m_Localized: Then it doesn't interest us.<p=5> Go out,<p=2> shoo. <p=5>It's time
      for my ninth snack break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520845
    m_Localized: (and I thought I was a glutton...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6611818790912
    m_Localized: 
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520846
    m_Localized: After saving the Star Spirits from the hive,<p=2> Chuchu is coming
      to the Moon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520847
    m_Localized: Haaaa...<p=5> Being a queen is the life...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520848
    m_Localized: <sh>YOUR MAJESTY!!!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520849
    m_Localized: What now,<p=2> Lubin?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520850
    m_Localized: This is terrible!<p=5> Chuchu is freeing every Star Spirit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520851
    m_Localized: <sh>What did you say?!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520852
    m_Localized: What do we do now?<p=5> Should we cancel the party?...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520853
    m_Localized: Hmpf,<p=2> this is out of the question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520854
    m_Localized: A chubby jeely like her will never be able to follow the rhythm
      of a moon queen!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520855
    m_Localized: <w>OHOHOHOHOHOHOH!</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520856
    m_Localized: Lychee,<p=2> stop being a baddie!<p=5> You're a coward!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520857
    m_Localized: We'll see who's the coward! <p=5>Your time has come! <p=5>Lubin!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520858
    m_Localized: Roger, <p=2>your most serene!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520859
    m_Localized: .<p=2>.<p=2>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520860
    m_Localized: Well then!<p=5> Where's the robot?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520861
    m_Localized: "Hum,<p=2> my liege...<p=5> There's no budget left for the robot,<p=2>
      the demo is over\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520862
    m_Localized: Ugh<p=2> it's been one of those days...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520863
    m_Localized: Victory!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13208326520864
    m_Localized: Congratulations!<p=5> You went all the way to the end!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
